{"fighter":[{"id":"ichigo","name":"黑崎·一护","comic_type":0,"source":"assets/fighter/ichigo.swf","start":1,"face":{"cls":"ichigo","big_cls":"ichigo_b","bar_cls":"ichigo_m","win_cls":"ichigo_w"},"says":["光是战斗根本没有意思 只是活下去也没有意义。","我也不知道为什么，总之很爽就是了！","正因为我们看不见，那才可怕。"],"bgm":"assets/bgm/char_ichigo.mp3"},{"id":"ichigo_bankai","name":"黑崎·一护 卍解","comic_type":0,"source":"assets/fighter/ichigo.swf","start":2,"face":{"cls":"ichigo_bankai","big_cls":"ichigo_bankai_b","bar_cls":"ichigo_bankai_m","win_cls":"ichigo_bankai_w"},"says":["光是战斗根本没有意思 只是活下去也没有意义。","我也不知道为什么，总之很爽就是了！","正因为我们看不见，那才可怕。"],"bgm":"assets/bgm/char_ichigo.mp3"},{"id":"ichigo_vizored_half","name":"黑崎·一护 半虚","comic_type":0,"source":"assets/fighter/ichigo.swf","start":3,"face":{"cls":"ichigo_vizored_half","big_cls":"ichigo_vizored_half_b","bar_cls":"ichigo_vizored_half_m","win_cls":"ichigo_vizored_half_w"},"says":["一护，王与坐骑的区别是什么？|不要告诉我是两只脚和四只脚的区别！","答案只有一个，那就是本能！|被刻印在事物最原始的根本上，透彻无比的杀戮本能！","你缺少的就是这个，这种露骨的本能！|所以你才比我弱啊，一护！"],"bgm":"assets/bgm/char_ichigo.mp3"},{"id":"ichigo_vizored","name":"黑崎·一护 虚化","comic_type":0,"source":"assets/fighter/ichigo.swf","start":4,"face":{"cls":"ichigo_vizored","big_cls":"ichigo_vizored_b","bar_cls":"ichigo_vizored_m","win_cls":"ichigo_vizored_half_w"},"says":["光是战斗根本没有意思 只是活下去也没有意义。","我也不知道为什么，总之很爽就是了！","正因为我们看不见，那才可怕。"],"bgm":"assets/bgm/bleach_boss.mp3"},{"id":"ichigo_zero","name":"黑崎·一护 零段","comic_type":0,"source":"assets/fighter/ichigo.swf","start":5,"face":{"cls":"ichigo_zero","big_cls":"ichigo_zero_b","bar_cls":"ichigo_zero_m","win_cls":"ichigo_w"},"says":["光是战斗根本没有意思 只是活下去也没有意义。","我也不知道为什么，总之很爽就是了！","正因为我们看不见，那才可怕。"],"bgm":"assets/bgm/char_ichigo.mp3"},{"id":"ogihci","name":"黑崎·一护 内虚","comic_type":0,"source":"assets/fighter/ichigo.swf","start":6,"face":{"cls":"ogihci","big_cls":"ogihci_b","bar_cls":"ogihci_m","win_cls":"ogihci_w"},"says":["一护，王与坐骑的区别是什么？|不要告诉我是两只脚和四只脚的区别！","答案只有一个，那就是本能！|被刻印在事物最原始的根本上，透彻无比的杀戮本能！","你缺少的就是这个，这种露骨的本能！|所以你才比我弱啊，一护！"],"bgm":"assets/bgm/char_ichigo.mp3"},{"id":"ogihci_bankai","name":"黑崎·一护 内虚 卍解","comic_type":0,"source":"assets/fighter/ichigo.swf","start":7,"face":{"cls":"ogihci_bankai","big_cls":"ogihci_bankai_b","bar_cls":"ogihci_bankai_m","win_cls":"ogihci_w"},"says":["一护，王与坐骑的区别是什么？|不要告诉我是两只脚和四只脚的区别！","答案只有一个，那就是本能！|被刻印在事物最原始的根本上，透彻无比的杀戮本能！","你缺少的就是这个，这种露骨的本能！|所以你才比我弱啊，一护！"],"bgm":"assets/bgm/bleach_boss.mp3"},{"id":"rukia","name":"朽木·露琪亚","comic_type":0,"source":"assets/fighter/rukia.swf","start":1,"face":{"cls":"rukia","big_cls":"rukia_b","bar_cls":"rukia_m","win_cls":"rukia_w"},"says":["命运是轮回的吗?还是伸向前方的? | 假如,是轮回的话,那就应该把那轮回之环击碎吗?  | 还是应该逆来顺受呢?","人们之所以能怀抱希望，是因为他们看不见死亡。"],"bgm":"assets/bgm/bleach.mp3"},{"id":"rukia_shikai","name":"朽木·露琪亚 始解","comic_type":0,"source":"assets/fighter/rukia.swf","start":2,"face":{"cls":"rukia_shikai","big_cls":"rukia_shikai_b","bar_cls":"rukia_shikai_m","win_cls":"rukia_shikai_w"},"says":["命运是轮回的吗?还是伸向前方的? | 假如,是轮回的话,那就应该把那轮回之环击碎吗?  | 还是应该逆来顺受呢?","人们之所以能怀抱希望，是因为他们看不见死亡。"],"bgm":"assets/bgm/bleach.mp3"},{"id":"renji","name":"阿散井·恋次","comic_type":0,"source":"assets/fighter/renji.swf","start":1,"face":{"cls":"renji","big_cls":"renji_b","bar_cls":"renji_m","win_cls":"renji_w"},"says":["我曾经发誓，我说过我一定要救她……|并没有向谁，仅仅是向我的——灵魂而发誓！","在触不到的燎牙上点火，就象不必仰望星星就能解决，|就象不必喊破喉咙就可以一样。"],"bgm":"assets/bgm/bleach.mp3"},{"id":"kenpachi","name":"更木·剑八","comic_type":0,"source":"assets/fighter/kenpachi.swf","start":1,"face":{"cls":"kenpachi","big_cls":"kenpachi_b","bar_cls":"kenpachi_m","win_cls":"kenpachi_w"},"says":["来吧、厮杀吧！","不畏惧死，为的是玩乐死亡。","每舍弃自尊一次，我们就越像是野兽。|每扼杀一颗心，我们就远离野兽一步。"],"bgm":"assets/bgm/bleach.mp3"},{"id":"ikkaku","name":"斑目·一角","comic_type":0,"source":"assets/fighter/ikkaku.swf","start":1,"face":{"cls":"ikkaku","big_cls":"ikkaku_b","bar_cls":"ikkaku_m","win_cls":"ikkaku_w"},"says":["我们每个人，打从出生的那一刻起就要迈向死亡。","无法超越死亡的人，那就必须去理解某些事。","结束总是在开始之前就已经存在了。"],"bgm":"assets/bgm/bleach.mp3"},{"id":"gin","name":"市丸·银","comic_type":0,"source":"assets/fighter/gin.swf","start":1,"face":{"cls":"gin","big_cls":"gin_b","bar_cls":"gin_m","win_cls":"gin_w"},"says":["我无话可说！","对不起，蓝染队长。","真没办法……"],"bgm":"assets/bgm/bleach.mp3"},{"id":"chad","name":"茶渡·泰虎","comic_type":0,"source":"assets/fighter/chad.swf","start":1,"face":{"cls":"chad","big_cls":"chad_b","bar_cls":"chad_m","win_cls":"chad_w"},"says":["如果手上没有剑，我就不能保护你。","如果我一直握着剑，我就无法抱紧你。","……"],"bgm":"assets/bgm/bleach.mp3"},{"id":"uryuu","name":"石田·雨龙","comic_type":0,"source":"assets/fighter/uryuu.swf","start":1,"face":{"cls":"uryuu","big_cls":"uryuu_b","bar_cls":"uryuu_m","win_cls":"uryuu_w"},"says":["我赌上灭却师的骄傲，一定要赢你！","不堪一击……"],"bgm":"assets/bgm/bleach.mp3"},{"id":"toushirou","name":"日番谷·东狮郎","comic_type":0,"source":"assets/fighter/toushirou.swf","start":1,"face":{"cls":"toushirou","big_cls":"toushirou_b","bar_cls":"toushirou_m","win_cls":"toushirou_w"},"says":["在强烈的阳光下，印在薄冰之上的足迹消失无踪。 | 不必害怕被欺骗，这世界原本就建立在假象之上。","不要叫我冬狮郎，是日番谷队长！","还差得远呢！"],"bgm":"assets/bgm/bleach.mp3"},{"id":"toushirou_bankai","name":"日番谷·东狮郎 卍解","comic_type":0,"source":"assets/fighter/toushirou.swf","start":2,"face":{"cls":"toushirou_bankai","big_cls":"toushirou_bankai_b","bar_cls":"toushirou_bankai_m","win_cls":"toushirou_bankai_w"},"says":["在强烈的阳光下，印在薄冰之上的足迹消失无踪。 | 不必害怕被欺骗，这世界原本就建立在假象之上。","不要叫我冬狮郎，是日番谷队长！","还差得远呢！"],"bgm":"assets/bgm/bleach.mp3"},{"id":"byakuya","name":"朽木·白哉","comic_type":0,"source":"assets/fighter/byakuya.swf","start":1,"face":{"cls":"byakuya","big_cls":"byakuya_b","bar_cls":"byakuya_m","win_cls":"byakuya_w"},"says":["真是迟钝啊。连倒下去都是这样。","喔……真没想到一介平民也能体会贵族的感受啊。","像你这种人，死在我的卍解之下，还早了一千年。"],"bgm":"assets/bgm/bleach.mp3"},{"id":"byakuya_bankai","name":"朽木·白哉 卍解","comic_type":0,"source":"assets/fighter/byakuya.swf","start":2,"face":{"cls":"byakuya_bankai","big_cls":"byakuya_bankai_b","bar_cls":"byakuya_bankai_m","win_cls":"byakuya_bankai_w"},"says":["真是迟钝啊。连倒下去都是这样。","喔……真没想到一介平民也能体会贵族的感受啊。","像你这种人，死在我的卍解之下，还早了一千年。"],"bgm":"assets/bgm/bleach.mp3"},{"id":"ulquiorra","name":"乌尔奇奥拉·西法","comic_type":0,"source":"assets/fighter/ulquiorra.swf","start":1,"face":{"cls":"ulquiorra","big_cls":"ulquiorra_b","bar_cls":"ulquiorra_m","win_cls":"ulquiorra_w"},"says":["太阳已经被我们击落了。","没有什么是我看不到的。","人类，真是到最后，也出人意料的生物。"],"bgm":"assets/bgm/bleach_boss.mp3"},{"id":"ulquiorra_resurreccion","name":"乌尔奇奥拉·西法 归刃","comic_type":0,"source":"assets/fighter/ulquiorra.swf","start":2,"face":{"cls":"ulquiorra_resurreccion","big_cls":"ulquiorra_resurreccion_b","bar_cls":"ulquiorra_resurreccion_m","win_cls":"ulquiorra_w"},"says":["太阳已经被我们击落了。","没有什么是我看不到的。","人类，真是到最后，也出人意料的生物。"],"bgm":"assets/bgm/bleach_boss.mp3"},{"id":"aizen","name":"蓝染·惣右介","comic_type":0,"source":"assets/fighter/aizen.swf","start":1,"face":{"cls":"aizen","big_cls":"aizen_b","bar_cls":"aizen_m","win_cls":"aizen_w"},"says":["这个世界在最初并没有真实,也没有谎言,只有俨然存在的事实,|可是,存在于这个世界的所有事物,|只会将对自己有利的事实误认为真实而活。","与实力并不相称的生命力也是一种浪费啊！","不能批判死者……","像你这样的水准,我不准你再次对我刀刃相向！","我们之所以觉得岩壁上的花很美，|那是因为我们就站在岩壁上的缘故，|不必害怕，因为我们像花那样，脚步并没有向外踩出去。"],"bgm":"assets/bgm/bleach_boss.mp3"},{"id":"mayuri","name":"涅·茧利","comic_type":0,"source":"assets/fighter/mayuri.swf","start":1,"face":{"cls":"mayuri","big_cls":"mayuri_b","bar_cls":"mayuri_m","win_cls":"mayuri_w"},"says":["我已经对你没兴趣了，闪一边去。","哎呀哎呀，浪费了我这么多时间。","药物每天8次，机器实验就每天5次吧，|而改造我也会尽量避免把你搞死。"],"bgm":"assets/bgm/bleach.mp3"},{"id":"orihime","name":"井上·织姬","comic_type":0,"source":"assets/fighter/orihime.swf","start":1,"face":{"cls":"orihime","big_cls":"orihime_b","bar_cls":"orihime_m","win_cls":"orihime_w"},"says":["如果我是那雨滴的话……|那么，我能够像把不曾交会的天空与大地连接起来那样……|把某人的心串联起来吗？","要是人生有五次就好了。|这样的话我五次都要住在不同的城镇，|五次都要做不同的工作……然后五次都要……喜欢上同一个人。"],"bgm":"assets/bgm/bleach.mp3"},{"id":"grimmjow","name":"葛力姆乔·贾卡杰克","comic_type":0,"source":"assets/fighter/grimmjow.swf","start":1,"face":{"cls":"grimmjow","big_cls":"grimmjow_b","bar_cls":"grimmjow_m","win_cls":"grimmjow_w"},"says":["不了解爱，也不了解光……只有破坏才是存在的证明！","啊哈哈哈哈哈……这下正好，死神，终于有杀你的价值了。","我不明白，我怎么会输给你这种货色！"],"bgm":"assets/bgm/bleach.mp3"},{"id":"soifon","name":"碎蜂","comic_type":0,"source":"assets/fighter/soifon.swf","start":1,"face":{"cls":"soifon","big_cls":"soifon_b","bar_cls":"soifon_m","win_cls":"soifon_w"},"says":["你的影子就像是……毫无目的的毒针一样……将我的去路给缝死。","你的光芒就像是……轻柔地打在水塔的雷一般……断绝了我的生命之源。"],"bgm":"assets/bgm/bleach.mp3"},{"id":"starrk","name":"柯雅泰·史塔克","comic_type":0,"source":"assets/fighter/starrk.swf","start":1,"face":{"cls":"starrk","big_cls":"starrk_b","bar_cls":"starrk_m","win_cls":"starrk_w"},"says":["难以忍受的孤独蚀骨吸髓，无法摆脱，无论怎样，只要不再一个人就好，甚至是将自己一分为二。","我厌恶孤独，但是它却如影随形。"],"bgm":"assets/bgm/bleach.mp3"},{"id":"naruto","name":"漩涡·鸣人","comic_type":1,"source":"assets/fighter/naruto.swf","start":1,"face":{"cls":"naruto","big_cls":"naruto_b","bar_cls":"naruto_m","win_cls":"naruto_w"},"says":["只要你变成全村人都认可的最棒忍者，|你就可以把火影这个名字抢过来！","我是绝对不会放弃的，因为这就是我的忍道！","好！我决定了,我要走一条属于我自己的忍道,|朝着绝对不让自己后悔的道路一直大步的走下去！"],"bgm":"assets/bgm/char_naruto.mp3"},{"id":"naruto_oneTail","name":"漩涡·鸣人 一尾","comic_type":1,"source":"assets/fighter/naruto.swf","start":2,"face":{"cls":"naruto_oneTail","big_cls":"naruto_oneTail_b","bar_cls":"naruto_oneTail_m","win_cls":"naruto_oneTail_w"},"says":["只要你变成全村人都认可的最棒忍者，|你就可以把火影这个名字抢过来！","我是绝对不会放弃的，因为这就是我的忍道！","好！我决定了,我要走一条属于我自己的忍道,|朝着绝对不让自己后悔的道路一直大步的走下去！"],"bgm":"assets/bgm/char_naruto.mp3"},{"id":"naruto_fourTail","name":"漩涡·鸣人 四尾","comic_type":1,"source":"assets/fighter/naruto.swf","start":3,"face":{"cls":"naruto_fourTail","big_cls":"naruto_fourTail_b","bar_cls":"naruto_fourTail_m","win_cls":"naruto_oneTail_w"},"says":["只要你变成全村人都认可的最棒忍者，|你就可以把火影这个名字抢过来！","我是绝对不会放弃的，因为这就是我的忍道！","好！我决定了,我要走一条属于我自己的忍道,|朝着绝对不让自己后悔的道路一直大步的走下去！"],"bgm":"assets/bgm/naruto_boss.mp3"},{"id":"naruto_sennin","name":"漩涡·鸣人 仙人","comic_type":1,"source":"assets/fighter/naruto.swf","start":4,"face":{"cls":"naruto_sennin","big_cls":"naruto_sennin_b","bar_cls":"naruto_sennin_m","win_cls":"naruto_sennin_w"},"says":["只要你变成全村人都认可的最棒忍者，|你就可以把火影这个名字抢过来！","我是绝对不会放弃的，因为这就是我的忍道！","好！我决定了,我要走一条属于我自己的忍道,|朝着绝对不让自己后悔的道路一直大步的走下去！"],"bgm":"assets/bgm/char_naruto.mp3"},{"id":"naruto_kyubi","name":"漩涡·鸣人 九尾","comic_type":1,"source":"assets/fighter/naruto.swf","start":5,"face":{"cls":"naruto_kyubi","big_cls":"naruto_kyubi_b","bar_cls":"naruto_kyubi_m","win_cls":"naruto_sennin_w"},"says":["只要你变成全村人都认可的最棒忍者，|你就可以把火影这个名字抢过来！","我是绝对不会放弃的，因为这就是我的忍道！","好！我决定了,我要走一条属于我自己的忍道,|朝着绝对不让自己后悔的道路一直大步的走下去！"],"bgm":"assets/bgm/naruto_boss.mp3"},{"id":"sakura","name":"春野·樱","comic_type":1,"source":"assets/fighter/sakura.swf","start":1,"face":{"cls":"sakura","big_cls":"sakura_b","bar_cls":"sakura_m","win_cls":"sakura_w"},"says":["我每次都受到其他人的保护，好不甘心哦……既然如此，这次……必须有我来保护我所珍惜的人们了……","我每次……都希望自己能够成为一个厉害的忍者……"],"bgm":"assets/bgm/naruto.mp3"},{"id":"sasuke","name":"宇智波·佐助","comic_type":1,"source":"assets/fighter/sasuke.swf","start":1,"face":{"cls":"sasuke","big_cls":"sasuke_b","bar_cls":"sasuke_m","win_cls":"sasuke_w"},"says":["羁绊太多，只会迷失自我。","孤独，不是被父母责备后难过的那种程度比得上的。","我是个复仇者，我是为复仇而生的，为了复仇我可以放弃一切。"],"bgm":"assets/bgm/char_sasuke.mp3"},{"id":"sasuke_juin","name":"宇智波·佐助 咒怨","comic_type":1,"source":"assets/fighter/sasuke.swf","start":2,"face":{"cls":"sasuke_juin","big_cls":"sasuke_juin_b","bar_cls":"sasuke_juin_m","win_cls":"sasuke_juin_w"},"says":["羁绊太多，只会迷失自我。","孤独，不是被父母责备后难过的那种程度比得上的。","我是个复仇者，我是为复仇而生的，为了复仇我可以放弃一切。"],"bgm":"assets/bgm/char_sasuke.mp3"},{"id":"sasuke_susanoo","name":"宇智波·佐助 须佐能乎","comic_type":1,"source":"assets/fighter/sasuke.swf","start":3,"face":{"cls":"sasuke_susanoo","big_cls":"sasuke_susanoo_b","bar_cls":"sasuke_susanoo_m","win_cls":"sasuke_susanoo_w"},"says":["羁绊太多，只会迷失自我。","孤独，不是被父母责备后难过的那种程度比得上的。","我是个复仇者，我是为复仇而生的，为了复仇我可以放弃一切。"],"bgm":"assets/bgm/char_sasuke.mp3"},{"id":"karin","name":"漩涡·香磷","comic_type":1,"source":"assets/fighter/karin.swf","start":1,"face":{"cls":"karin","big_cls":"karin_b","bar_cls":"karin_m","win_cls":"karin_w"},"says":["佐助，人家想和佐助两个人……","真想再看一次他那时的面庞","佐助，你在哪里？等等我……"],"bgm":"assets/bgm/naruto.mp3"},{"id":"juggo","name":"天秤·重吾","comic_type":1,"source":"assets/fighter/juggo.swf","start":1,"face":{"cls":"juggo","big_cls":"juggo_b","bar_cls":"juggo_m","win_cls":"juggo_w"},"says":["……","哈哈哈哈哈哈","我不会再失控了。"],"bgm":"assets/bgm/naruto.mp3"},{"id":"itachi","name":"宇智波·鼬","comic_type":1,"source":"assets/fighter/itachi.swf","start":1,"face":{"cls":"itachi","big_cls":"itachi_b","bar_cls":"itachi_m","win_cls":"itachi_w"},"says":["优秀也是有烦恼的……","人类就是这样，自以为自己知道了什么，就否定了自己不知道的东西，只会局限在自己的知识范围内自以为是……","只要是人，都是依靠自己的知识与认知并且也被之束缚生活着的，|那就叫做现实。|但是，知识与认知是暧昧不清的东西，现实也许只是镜花水月。"],"bgm":"assets/bgm/naruto_boss.mp3"},{"id":"deidara","name":"迪达拉","comic_type":1,"source":"assets/fighter/deidara.swf","start":1,"face":{"cls":"deidara","big_cls":"deidara_b","bar_cls":"deidara_m","win_cls":"deidara_w"},"says":["艺术就是爆炸！嗯。","我的忍术全都是艺术！嗯。","艺术是美丽而短暂的，消失那一瞬间 才称为美丽，嗯。"],"bgm":"assets/bgm/naruto.mp3"},{"id":"kakashi","name":"旗木·卡卡西","comic_type":1,"source":"assets/fighter/kakashi.swf","start":1,"face":{"cls":"kakashi","big_cls":"kakashi_b","bar_cls":"kakashi_m","win_cls":"kakashi_w"},"says":["忍者是不能按常理来思考的！","放心吧，就算死我也会保护你们的，我绝对不让我的同伴被杀。","以现在的你是赢不了我的，你根本不明白什么是真正的强大！"],"bgm":"assets/bgm/naruto.mp3"},{"id":"kakashi_kamui","name":"旗木·卡卡西 神威","comic_type":1,"source":"assets/fighter/kakashi.swf","start":2,"face":{"cls":"kakashi_kamui","big_cls":"kakashi_kamui_b","bar_cls":"kakashi_kamui_m","win_cls":"kakashi_kamui_w"},"says":["忍者是不能按常理来思考的！","放心吧，就算死我也会保护你们的，我绝对不让我的同伴被杀。","以现在的你是赢不了我的，你根本不明白什么是真正的强大！"],"bgm":"assets/bgm/naruto.mp3"},{"id":"lee","name":"李·洛克","comic_type":1,"source":"assets/fighter/lee.swf","start":1,"face":{"cls":"lee","big_cls":"lee_b","bar_cls":"lee_m","win_cls":"lee_w"},"says":["我就是木叶美丽的苍蓝之兽——李洛克","现在就是我贯彻我的忍道的时候了！","我要证明就算不会用体术或幻术也能成为一个了不起的忍者！"],"bgm":"assets/bgm/naruto.mp3"},{"id":"lee_tomon","name":"李·洛克 杜门","comic_type":1,"source":"assets/fighter/lee.swf","start":2,"face":{"cls":"lee_tomon","big_cls":"lee_tomon_b","bar_cls":"lee_tomon_m","win_cls":"lee_w"},"says":["我就是木叶美丽的苍蓝之兽——李洛克","现在就是我贯彻我的忍道的时候了！","我要证明就算不会用体术或幻术也能成为一个了不起的忍者！"],"bgm":"assets/bgm/naruto.mp3"},{"id":"neji","name":"日向·宁次","comic_type":1,"source":"assets/fighter/neji.swf","start":1,"face":{"cls":"neji","big_cls":"neji_b","bar_cls":"neji_m","win_cls":"neji_w"},"says":["我从来都不认为——上忍就是终点！","人的命运，是从一出生就被注定了。","命运，从对手是我的那一刻开始便被决定了。"],"bgm":"assets/bgm/naruto.mp3"},{"id":"gaara","name":"我爱罗","comic_type":1,"source":"assets/fighter/gaara.swf","start":1,"face":{"cls":"gaara","big_cls":"gaara_b","bar_cls":"gaara_m","win_cls":"gaara_w"},"says":["就只有这样而已吗?"],"bgm":"assets/bgm/naruto.mp3"},{"id":"temari","name":"手鞠","comic_type":1,"source":"assets/fighter/temari.swf","start":1,"face":{"cls":"temari","big_cls":"temari_b","bar_cls":"temari_m","win_cls":"temari_w"},"says":["笨蛋！","哼！不堪一击！"],"bgm":"assets/bgm/naruto.mp3"},{"id":"jiraiya","name":"自来也","comic_type":1,"source":"assets/fighter/jiraiya.swf","start":1,"face":{"cls":"jiraiya","big_cls":"jiraiya_b","bar_cls":"jiraiya_m","win_cls":"jiraiya_w"},"says":["不分东南西北，整个天下都是无人能敌的三忍白发童子蛤蟆使者。","对于忍者而言怎样活着无所谓，怎样死去才是最重要的。","忍者指的是能忍耐的人"],"bgm":"assets/bgm/naruto.mp3"},{"id":"orochimaru","name":"大蛇丸","comic_type":1,"source":"assets/fighter/orochimaru.swf","start":1,"face":{"cls":"orochimaru","big_cls":"orochimaru_b","bar_cls":"orochimaru_m","win_cls":"orochimaru_w"},"says":["条约只是让对手麻痹的伪装，从现在开始历史将被改写","有形的东西迟早会毁灭，无形的东西才会永恒！","肉体的生命太短暂,太无常"],"bgm":"assets/bgm/naruto_boss.mp3"},{"id":"killerbee","name":"奇拉比","comic_type":1,"source":"assets/fighter/killerbee.swf","start":1,"face":{"cls":"killerbee","big_cls":"killerbee_b","bar_cls":"killerbee_m","win_cls":"killerbee_w"},"says":["你这笨蛋，你这混蛋！","哟！本大爷是最强的！哟！","哟！你这笨蛋，你这混蛋！哟！……"],"bgm":"assets/bgm/naruto.mp3"},{"id":"pain","name":"佩恩","comic_type":1,"source":"assets/fighter/pain.swf","start":1,"face":{"cls":"pain","big_cls":"pain_b","bar_cls":"pain_m","win_cls":"pain_w"},"says":["……"],"bgm":"assets/bgm/naruto_boss.mp3"},{"id":"konan","name":"小南","comic_type":1,"source":"assets/fighter/konan.swf","start":1,"face":{"cls":"konan","big_cls":"konan_b","bar_cls":"konan_m","win_cls":"konan_w"},"says":["……"],"bgm":"assets/bgm/naruto.mp3"},{"id":"obito","name":"宇智波·带土","comic_type":1,"source":"assets/fighter/obito.swf","start":1,"face":{"cls":"obito","big_cls":"obito_b","bar_cls":"obito_m","win_cls":"obito_w"},"says":["不重视同伴的人，连废物都不如！","现实越残酷，内心的空洞就越大。","这个世界已无所谓的希望，希望和放弃没有任何的区别，|只是一种敷衍的托词罢了。","我谁也不是，也不想变成谁。。。。"],"bgm":"assets/bgm/naruto_boss.mp3"},{"id":"obito_majime","name":"宇智波·带土 真面目","comic_type":1,"source":"assets/fighter/obito.swf","start":2,"face":{"cls":"obito_majime","big_cls":"obito_majime_b","bar_cls":"obito_majime_m","win_cls":"obito_w"},"says":["不重视同伴的人，连废物都不如！","现实越残酷，内心的空洞就越大。","这个世界已无所谓的希望，希望和放弃没有任何的区别，|只是一种敷衍的托词罢了。","我谁也不是，也不想变成谁。。。。"],"bgm":"assets/bgm/naruto_boss.mp3"},{"id":"madara","name":"宇智波·斑","comic_type":1,"source":"assets/fighter/madara.swf","start":1,"face":{"cls":"madara","big_cls":"madara_b","bar_cls":"madara_m","win_cls":"madara_w"},"says":["现在的我没有力量，换句话说，现在的我只是一具躯壳罢了。","世间的一切与我融为一体，我将成为一统所有的完全体。","神话是仿效事实被传承的。","一切攻击对我宇智波斑是没用的。","好吧，第四次忍界大战，我在此向你们宣战！","要控制别人，就要学会利用其内心黑暗的技巧。"],"bgm":"assets/bgm/naruto_boss.mp3"},{"id":"kimimaro","name":"君麻吕","comic_type":1,"source":"assets/fighter/kimimaro.swf","start":1,"face":{"cls":"kimimaro","big_cls":"kimimaro_b","bar_cls":"kimimaro_m","win_cls":"kimimaro_w"},"says":["好吧，想怎么个死法","人是为了某种目的而降生的，我坚信，活着便有重要的使命。","也许的确是这样…我的身体病魔缠身，不能坚持很久…但是，我不会灭亡…而且我不是一个人…作为担当起大蛇丸大人一部分野心的人…我将在大蛇丸大人的心中永存…"],"bgm":"assets/bgm/naruto.mp3"},{"id":"kenshin","name":"绯村·剑心","comic_type":0,"source":"assets/fighter/kenshin.swf","start":1,"face":{"cls":"kenshin","big_cls":"kenshin_b","bar_cls":"kenshin_m","win_cls":"kenshin_w"},"says":["剑是凶器，剑技是杀人的伎俩，|无论用多么美丽的语言去掩饰，那始终是事实","……"],"bgm":"assets/bgm/bleach_boss.mp3"},{"id":"kenshin_battousai","name":"绯村·剑心 拔刀斋","comic_type":0,"source":"assets/fighter/kenshin.swf","start":2,"face":{"cls":"kenshin_battousai","big_cls":"kenshin_battousai_b","bar_cls":"kenshin_battousai_m","win_cls":"kenshin_w"},"says":["剑是凶器，剑技是杀人的伎俩，|无论用多么美丽的语言去掩饰，那始终是事实","……"],"bgm":"assets/bgm/bleach_boss.mp3"}],"assist":[{"id":"kon","name":"魂","comic_type":0,"source":"assets/fighter/assistant/kon.swf","start":1,"face":{"cls":"kon","big_cls"